WEBVTT

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:08.220
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:14.730
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.560
It's my day!

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:27.140
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:34.550
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:41.920
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:49.330
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:55.100
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:02.240
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:09.750
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:15.890
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:18.950
I just want to walk

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:22.490
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:26.460
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:35.370
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:41.810
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:44.080
It's my day!

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:50.960
Oh, Grandma! What big ears you have!

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:53.150
All the better to
hear you with, my dear.

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:55.840
Oh, Grandma!
What a big mouth you have!

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:58.030
All the better to eat you with!

00:02:02.530 --> 00:02:03.930
Tsukasa! How dare you!

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:05.870
No... Sis! Hold it!

00:02:10.370 --> 00:02:19.380
"Please Believe Me!"

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:30.860
<i>I still can't believe
Sakurako was so nasty.</i>

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:38.630
<i>I don't need you anymore!
Just get lost, you ugly waste!</i>

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:48.210
<i>I wonder if Domyoji
saw that photo...</i>

00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:01.020
<i>But...</i>

00:03:02.190 --> 00:03:05.090
<i>I thought I hated that guy.</i>

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:08.230
<i>Who cares if he sees that photo?</i>

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:11.960
<i>But for some strange reason...</i>

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:15.800
<i>...I feel like I don't want 
to disappoint him.</i>

00:03:29.380 --> 00:03:30.980
<i>It's such a beautiful morning...</i>

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:35.250
<i>Yet I feel like a prisoner
before execution.</i>

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:40.190
<i>What are you so scared of, Tsukushi?!</i>

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:44.740
<i>A "go" sign.</i>

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:48.710
<i>Right! I decided I wouldn't run...</i>

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:51.400
<i>...so here I go!</i>

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:27.100
<i>No one's here...</i>

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:29.110
<i>It's eerie.</i>

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:52.500
You've got guts, coming back here.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.540
You think we'll just let you?

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:03.550
What're you doing?!

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:12.950
Time to take out the trash!

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:22.370
Tsukushi!

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:37.190
Get her!

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:38.050
Over that way!

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:58.420
<i>I'm Tsukushi the Weed!</i>

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:04.100
<i>As if I'd bow before hothouse
flowers like you.</i>

00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:20.080
Get her!

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.130
Hold her down!

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:31.660
You fooled us.
Now it's payback time!

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:33.190
Serves her right.

00:06:33.730 --> 00:06:34.990
Let her have it!

00:06:39.230 --> 00:06:39.860
Tsukushi!

00:06:45.140 --> 00:06:45.770
Cut it out!

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:49.540
What's going on?

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:52.920
You think I'm gonna let you
get away with this?

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:55.410
<i>Domyoji!</i>

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:38.550
You're wrong, Domyoji!

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:42.300
I feel so sorry for you.

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:46.610
Don't you know that
Makino was fooling around on you?

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:48.800
Look at this picture!

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:54.900
She fooled us all.

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:59.620
Domyoji, she deserves
what she's getting.

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:02.960
They're doing this for your sake.

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:09.120
Domyoji...

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:16.830
Domyoji! Don't believe her!

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:19.790
She set all this up!

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:35.510
I admit that I took advantage 
of the fact that we went out.

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:38.380
But... the photo is a lie!

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:43.650
I don't care if no one else
believes me...

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:47.860
...as long as you do!

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:50.420
Makino...

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:55.000
Domyoji, don't be fooled!

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:58.030
The pictures are unshakable proof!

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:15.520
<i>Domyoji...</i>

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:30.960
<i>I don't care if no one else
believes me...</i>

00:09:31.260 --> 00:09:33.730
<i>...as long as you do!</i>

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:42.160
<i>Domyoji!</i>

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:46.140
Wait! I said wait, you fool!

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:47.610
You stupid jerk!

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:53.470
Stupid! I thought you,
of all people, would believe me!

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:21.550
What are you doing?!

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:22.450
Stop it!

00:10:24.150 --> 00:10:24.780
Let me go!

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:25.950
Hold her!

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:28.390
Just wait and see!

00:10:31.420 --> 00:10:33.820
<i>What are they going to do?</i>

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:43.500
I'll get some tea.

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:57.550
<i>I don't care if no one else
believes me...</i>

00:10:57.880 --> 00:11:00.750
<i>...as long as you do!</i>

00:11:03.620 --> 00:11:08.090
<i>Stupid! I thought you, of all people,
would believe me!</i>

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:46.760
Oh, Grandma! 
What big ears you have!

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:53.700
Where am I? Why'm I here?

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:57.140
How mean... Don't you remember?

00:11:57.870 --> 00:11:58.870
This is my house.

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:02.840
You drove me home
in your car, Domyoji.

00:12:05.350 --> 00:12:07.380
You must think I'm so childish.

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:10.350
Hanging on to such old dolls.

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:14.320
But... these dolls are special to me.

00:12:14.990 --> 00:12:15.560
Me, too.

00:12:16.120 --> 00:12:16.550
Huh?

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:20.960
I see.

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:23.560
Yeah!

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:33.440
Aren't they going overboard?

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:35.140
What if she dies?

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:42.010
Let Tsukushi go!

00:12:42.310 --> 00:12:43.180
Kazuya!

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:46.510
Tsukushi!

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:48.020
Kazuya, stay away!

00:12:48.020 --> 00:12:49.320
Stay out of this!

00:12:54.990 --> 00:12:56.750
Tsu... ku... shi!

00:12:57.030 --> 00:12:59.770
How low can you get?

00:13:01.270 --> 00:13:02.700
Do whatever you want!

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:04.870
I'll show you what I'm made of!

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:47.130
I begged my parents for those dolls...

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:49.580
...when I was in grade school.

00:13:51.050 --> 00:13:55.020
But then they died
in a plane crash.

00:13:55.950 --> 00:13:58.120
I live with my grandparents now.

00:14:00.390 --> 00:14:01.870
Maybe that's better than having...

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:03.890
...parents who are alive,
but are never around.

00:14:05.090 --> 00:14:06.610
My parents both went
to live abroad...

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:08.330
...when I was just a kid.

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:11.430
I don't ever remember them
acting like parents.

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:16.300
So you lived
with just your sister?

00:14:17.470 --> 00:14:18.140
Well, yeah.

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:20.740
But she got married.

00:14:32.320 --> 00:14:33.590
You must be lonely.

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:36.630
Are you kidding?

00:14:37.190 --> 00:14:39.360
It's a relief without
all the nagging adults around.

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:40.500
You're kidding me!

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:44.180
You can say that only because...

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:46.470
...your family members
are alive and well.

00:14:48.940 --> 00:14:49.770
You...

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:21.440
My mother cherished this cherry tree.

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:25.740
I was named "Sakura" after this tree.

00:15:27.140 --> 00:15:29.640
But it didn't blossom this year.

00:15:30.940 --> 00:15:33.480
There's no one to take care
of the garden anymore...

00:15:34.310 --> 00:15:36.320
And the roots are rotting.

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:41.120
It's very sad to lose your memories.

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:06.880
Tsukushi!

00:16:09.310 --> 00:16:12.350
<i>I won't lose!
Not to those jerks!</i>

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:15.420
<i>I'll show them how strong
a weed can be!</i>

00:16:18.020 --> 00:16:18.360
Hey!

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:24.330
Please stop!

00:16:25.100 --> 00:16:26.500
You shut up!

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:28.930
Tsukushi!

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:30.870
Pull her along!
Pick up the speed!

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:42.880
Are you all right?

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:46.980
It's getting chilly.
Let's go inside.

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:29.960
Domyoji...

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:36.170
I've always loved you...

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:43.740
But you were always with Makino...

00:17:49.780 --> 00:17:50.850
Makino?

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:54.320
Domyoji!

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:11.230
I left Makino there...

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:14.740
Please don't go.

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:21.480
Wait!

00:18:25.210 --> 00:18:26.150
Wait!

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:31.070
<i>Wait!</i>

00:18:31.070 --> 00:18:32.030
<i>Stop!</i>

00:18:32.030 --> 00:18:34.050
<i>Wait, you idiot!</i>

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:39.260
Please don't go! Please!

00:18:39.960 --> 00:18:41.700
I've always, always loved you!

00:18:42.060 --> 00:18:43.900
Please stay!

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:48.580
<i>I don't care if no one else
believes me...</i>

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:51.470
<i>...as long as you do!</i>

00:18:52.740 --> 00:18:56.180
<i>You call yourself a man?
What you're doing is dirty!</i>

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:02.520
<i>I'm no-brand. Don't put me together
with all the other girls out there.</i>

00:19:03.850 --> 00:19:05.890
<i>Domyoji, don't go!</i>

00:19:15.770 --> 00:19:16.730
Get away!

00:19:17.030 --> 00:19:18.230
Don't touch me!

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:24.550
Why does it have to be
Tsukushi Makino?!

00:19:24.550 --> 00:19:25.740
What do you see in her?!

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:36.380
You're the only one for me!

00:19:37.350 --> 00:19:39.950
I'll never cheat on you
like Makino!

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:40.790
So...

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:44.060
Makino would never do that.

00:19:45.690 --> 00:19:47.690
Say another word and
I'll slap you down.

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:11.650
<i>Why did I bother anyway?</i>

00:20:19.190 --> 00:20:22.730
<i>I don't care what happens to me anymore.
I just don't care!</i>

00:20:35.470 --> 00:20:36.540
It's Domyoji!

00:21:19.350 --> 00:21:19.910
Sorry.

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:30.120
If you say it didn't happen...

00:21:31.990 --> 00:21:32.890
I believe you.

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:46.040
I believe in you.

00:22:04.690 --> 00:22:10.760
You let your hair down a little

00:22:12.730 --> 00:22:18.640
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:20.410 --> 00:22:28.510
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:28.750 --> 00:22:36.560
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:36.560 --> 00:22:44.330
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:44.600 --> 00:22:52.470
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:44.600 --> 00:22:52.470
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:52.470 --> 00:23:00.850
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:52.470 --> 00:23:00.850
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:10.620
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:10.620 --> 00:23:18.400
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:18.660 --> 00:23:26.570
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:18.660 --> 00:23:26.570
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:26.570 --> 00:23:34.980
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:26.570 --> 00:23:34.980
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:45.560 --> 00:23:48.120
Sorry you had to go through
this on account of me.

00:23:48.830 --> 00:23:49.660
Tsukasa...

00:23:50.730 --> 00:23:52.330
I was unable to move...

00:23:52.400 --> 00:23:55.200
...as he looked straight at me
with his clear, doleful eyes...

00:23:55.260 --> 00:23:56.330
I was speechless.

00:23:56.900 --> 00:24:01.370
But I think maybe, deep down,
this is what I had hoped for.

00:24:02.240 --> 00:24:05.810
Next on Hana Yori Dango:
"Mine at Last!"

00:24:06.710 --> 00:24:08.340
Tsukasa's feelings...
